From 692279d4cd56b5a07b504e8254964a24344da18a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 02:11:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] style: soften inner lines and rebalance glaring schemes
 (v1.4.3 preview)

- new --line token: inner dividers, bars, strips and table cells use a
  mix of ink and paper; outer frames, header and buttons keep full ink
- Tokyo Night Day: neutral indigo ink, light blue header with dark text
- PSG: midnight navy paper, off-white ink, gold band under the header
- Monokai / Dracula: dimmer foreground, lower-chroma signal colours
- Catppuccin Latte: soft mauve header with dark text
- Solarized: brighter yellow header (4.6:1 -> 7.2:1)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017zt6qgJTYX8RkfDpxVcSTg
---
 README.md         |   2 +
 komari-theme.json |   2 +-
 src/styles.css    | 136 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------------
 3 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 57 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 9c3ea32..7fd4751 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -86,6 +86,8 @@ Fork of [r1cebucket/komari-theme-1999](https://github.com/r1cebucket/komari-them
 
 色值取自各配色方案的官方调色板（球队主题取自俱乐部官方色），卡片、三网历史条、图表和提示框都会跟随切换。所有配色都经过 WCAG 对比度核验，正文、次要文字、页头文字和分级数字均 ≥ 4.5:1（个别强调色为此做了极小幅的明度微调）。所选配色会记在浏览器本地，下次打开时不会先闪白屏。
 
+本皮肤线条密集，所以线条分两级：卡片外框、页头和按钮用正文色，卡片内部的分隔线、进度条框、表格格线和三网历史条用正文色与底色的混合色，降低满屏高对比细线带来的晃眼感；文字对比度不受影响。
+
 ### 节点详情
 
 详情弹窗新增 BILLING & TRAFFIC 区块：价格、到期日、剩余天数、剩余价值、重置日、下次重置时间、剩余流量、日均可用。
